# Generated by Cargo
# will have compiled files and executables
debug/
target/

# These are backup files generated by rustfmt
**/*.rs.bk

# MSVC Windows builds of rustc generate these, which store debugging information
*.pdb

.vscode/

__pycache__/

# Ignore these.
db_data/

.DS_Store

# Prebuilt algorithm binaries fetched by download_algorithm, plus the PTX and
# .so artifacts build_algorithm emits. Large, regenerable, and per-machine.
tig-algorithms/lib/

# Linker map files emitted at the repo root while building algorithm shared
# objects. Root-anchored: dist/ has tracked swagger-ui source maps.
/*.map

# Agent session state and worktrees
.claude/

# Subagent-driven-development scratch: ledgers, briefs, review packages.
# Regenerable coordination state; the git history is the real record.
.superpowers/

# Standalone kernel micro-benchmarks. Scratch harnesses for measuring a kernel
# in isolation; they live on the GPU host and are never part of the build.
/bench_*.cu

# Model checkpoints and dataset dumps. The generator weights this challenge
# ships are committed deliberately via an explicit negation when added, since
# every verifier needs byte-identical weights.
*.pt
*.pth
*.safetensors
*.npy
*.hdf5